sstack reuses and adapts text and code from the projects below.
Each entry names one source file, the files of this repo that use it, and how.
"Adapted" means that we copied text or code and changed it. "Idea only" means
that we took an idea and wrote our own text. The "## Provenance" section of each
skill, and the header of each script, says what we changed.

Source repos and the commits we read:

